      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 5.27,
          "end": 5.75,
          "en": "All right.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.75,
          "end": 8.6,
          "en": "In this lecture we are going to look at graph representation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 8.63,
          "end": 12.11,
          "en": "Now graph representation is how we are implementing the graph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 12.11,
          "end": 17.12,
          "en": "So there are two ways of implementing the graph adjacency matrix and adjacency list.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 17.12,
          "end": 19.22,
          "en": "So we are going to look at them one by one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 19.22,
          "end": 21.65,
          "en": "So the first one is adjacency matrix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.65,
          "end": 27.44,
          "en": "Now when we are implementing the graph using the adjacency matrix basically we are creating a square",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 27.44,
          "end": 28.16,
          "en": "matrix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 28.16,
          "end": 30.53,
          "en": "Or we can say two dimensional array.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.53,
          "end": 37.13,
          "en": "And the elements of the matrix indicate whether pairs of vertices are adjacent or not.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 37.13,
          "end": 40.07,
          "en": "So let's say we have a graph like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 40.07,
          "end": 43.79,
          "en": "So you can easily see that this is undirected unweighted graph.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 43.79,
          "end": 49.43,
          "en": "So here to be able to represent this using the matrix we are going to create the two dimensional array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 49.43,
          "end": 52.58,
          "en": "with the number of the vertices that we have over here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 52.58,
          "end": 54.17,
          "en": "So here we have five vertices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 54.17,
          "end": 58.28,
          "en": "So this means that this two dimensional array is going to be 5 to 5.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 58.31,
          "end": 62.99,
          "en": "Then to populate the cells of this matrix we are going to check the vertices one by one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 62.99,
          "end": 64.82,
          "en": "So we are going to start from a.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 64.85,
          "end": 69.44,
          "en": "So from a we can go to B and from A we can go to D.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 69.44,
          "end": 71.63,
          "en": "And from a we can go to C.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 71.63,
          "end": 75.47,
          "en": "So we need to populate this edge in the matrix over here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 75.47,
          "end": 77.28999999999999,
          "en": "So we are going to start from a.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 77.32,
          "end": 79.6,
          "en": "So from a we can go to B.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 79.6,
          "end": 83.8,
          "en": "So this means that this cell over here is going to be populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 83.8,
          "end": 85.51,
          "en": "So this is a B cell.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 85.51,
          "end": 87.43,
          "en": "Then from A we can go to C.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 87.43,
          "end": 90.22,
          "en": "So this cell also is going to be populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 90.22,
          "end": 93.7,
          "en": "And from a we can go to D and it's going to be populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.72999999999999,
          "end": 99.13,
          "en": "Now the other cells that we have over here, we cannot go to from A to a, we cannot go to from A to",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 99.16,
          "end": 99.28,
          "en": "E.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 99.31,
          "end": 102.55,
          "en": "So that's why these cells will be populated with zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 102.55,
          "end": 107.97999999999999,
          "en": "Basically, when we are creating the matrix all elements will be initially populated with zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 108.00999999999999,
          "end": 110.77000000000001,
          "en": "Then we are going to populate the ones which we have h.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 110.8,
          "end": 112.57,
          "en": "Now the next verse is b.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.57,
          "end": 116.17,
          "en": "So from B we can go to a and from b we can go to E.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.2,
          "end": 122.23,
          "en": "So similarly we'll start from B and from b we can go to A as we seen from here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 122.23,
          "end": 123.94,
          "en": "So it's going to be populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.94,
          "end": 127.48,
          "en": "So from B we can go to E and it's going to be populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 127.51,
          "end": 130.18,
          "en": "All rest cells will be populated with zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.21,
          "end": 132.58,
          "en": "Then we are going to continue to the next vertex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.58,
          "end": 134.35,
          "en": "The next vertex is c.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 134.38,
          "end": 136.69,
          "en": "So from c we can go to a.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 136.69,
          "end": 138.57999999999998,
          "en": "And from c we can go to D.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 138.57999999999998,
          "end": 140.98,
          "en": "So we are going to go to the matrix.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 140.98,
          "end": 142.45,
          "en": "From C we can go to A.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 142.45,
