          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 144.1,
          "end": 148.18,
          "en": "And from C we can go to D and it's going to be populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.18,
          "end": 151.72,
          "en": "So c d cell is populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.72,
          "end": 154.5,
          "en": "All other cells will be populated with zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 154.53,
          "end": 156.03,
          "en": "Then the next vertex is d.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 156.06,
          "end": 158.07,
          "en": "So from D we can go to C.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.1,
          "end": 160.71,
          "en": "We can go to a and we can go to E.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 160.71,
          "end": 163.74,
          "en": "So all these cells will be populated with one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 163.74,
          "end": 167.22,
          "en": "So from D we can go to a it's going to be populated with one.",
